{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ちそっち！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様って言葉、いっぱい嬉しいです！ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちそっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんが考えたこのあだ名結構は好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のレポート(　・´ｰ・｀)ぽぺ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太ったむぎ太と戯れて、久しぶりのままの手料理を食べて、漫画を1から読み返して、実家でのんびりしまくってますえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/12/3246467/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい！どっさんもリフレッシュ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして放課後の学校にヤッホーと顔を出しにいきました！ヤッホー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同級生はみんな就職進学で忙しいみたいです。ダンス部は暑い中、文化祭にむけて頑張っていました。後輩さん達が可愛かった...若いね...これから頑張ってね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院に行ってカラーとヘッドスパをしてもらいました！髪色はちょっと\"純\"な感じに暗くしてもらい、人生初のヘッドスパ...(　ﾟдﾟ　)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(　ﾟдﾟ　)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爆睡でした(　ﾟдﾟ　)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭皮マッサージ？も気持ちよかった～。リフレッシュ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とご飯や買い物にも行きたいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/12/3246467/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少年サンデー、少年マガジン、BOG、さんに載っています！もしよかったらみてくださいえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マギおもしろい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/12/3246467/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやく冬にならんかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りましょう(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}